                      <SHORT-NAME>SDAdcStepDetectionMode</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Step Detection Mode.Defines when the slew rate filter is activated.                                  SDADC_STEP_DETECTION_MODE_LAST_INPUT: Compare threshold to difference of current and last input.                                  SDADC_STEP_DETECTION_MODE_SECOND_LAST_INPUT: Compare threshold to difference of current and second-last input.</L-2>
                      </DESC>
